      "text": ".gsd_transform_hyp()  per hypothesis\n.gsd_looks() -> looks, maturity\nsingle matured look? copy raw forward\nelse .gsd_boundary_table(): log grid of\nlevels on 1e-14 to alpha, one\ngsDesign::gsBound1() call per level\n.gsd_check_well_ordered()\n.gsd_invert() log-log, per look\ncopy forward past maturity\npmin along looks if look_back[i]",
